Dear Sir,

=20

Please see the below details.

=20

Marine & Offshore Fabrication Services

We are proud to offer specialized marine and offshore fabrication =
services
designed to meet the demanding needs of the maritime and offshore =
industry.
With a team of highly skilled and class-certified welders and fitters, =
we
deliver top-quality fabrication and welding solutions=97offshore, at
anchorage, in port, or even while vessels are sailing.

Why Choose Us?

Our crew brings years of experience from major shipyards and offshore
environments. Fully compliant with international safety standards, all
personnel are equipped with valid CDCs, up-to-date vaccinations, and
offshore safety training. This ensures we maintain operational =
excellence
with minimal downtime and maximum efficiency.

Our Core Strengths

*	Class-Certified Welders & Fitters
Skilled professionals with extensive experience in marine and offshore
industries.
*	Mobilized Riding Squads
Ready-to-deploy teams with valid CDCs and offshore credentials, ensuring
quick turnaround for sailing assignments.
*	Versatile Operations
Capable of executing projects offshore, at anchorage, during port calls, =
or
in transit=97based on your operational needs.
*	Shipyard-Experienced Workforce
Practical know-how from major global shipyards guarantees top-tier =
quality
and precision.

Our Services

*	Deployment of Class-Certified Welders (4G to 6G) & Fabricators
During Sailing
*	Structural Steel Repairs
Repairs in tanks, decks, and hulls as per class recommendations and
inspection reports.
*	Structural & Piping Modifications
End-to-end support including design, engineering, and execution.
*	Port-Based Fabrication Services
Access to all major ports in Qatar via valid port passes, ensuring =
timely
support during port calls and maintenance periods.
*	Pre-Fabrication & Offshore Installation
Skilled teams for structural and piping installation offshore.
*	High-Pressure & Low-Pressure Line Re-Routing
Custom re-routing solutions for offshore rigs and platforms.
*	Installation Services
Includes C&K manifolds, well test lines, and flare booms.
*	Sea fastening services for offshore mobilizations

=20

=20

=20

Kind Regards

=20

From Aries Group, Qatar=20
Ajith V.S
